    {
      "name": "Home",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Home Bootstrap",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"filter\": \"all\",\n  \"country\": [\"IN\"],\n  \"device_id\": \"{{deviceId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/home/bootstrap",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "home",
                "bootstrap"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Fast first-paint Home payload.\n\nReturns hero + bootstrap rows + genres + `secondary_rows` for progressive loading.\n\n**Body**\n- `filter`: all | movies | tv (default all)\n- `country`: \"IN\" or [\"IN\"]\n- `device_id` (optional) -> my_list row\n\n**Response `rows` keys:** trending_movies, trending_tv, top_10, new_releases, my_list"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Home Row",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"filter\": \"all\",\n  \"country\": [\"IN\"],\n  \"row\": \"action\",\n  \"device_id\": \"{{deviceId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/home/row",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "home",
                "row"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Single Home row for progressive loading.\n\n**Body**\n- `row` (required): hindi | tamil | telugu | malayalam | action | thriller | crime | drama | comedy | romance | horror | animation | scifi | on_netflix | jiohotstar | prime_video | zee5 | top_rated | (also bootstrap keys)\n- `filter`: all | movies | tv\n- `country`: \"IN\" or [\"IN\"]\n- `device_id` (optional; needed for my_list)\n\n**Response:** `{ filter, country, row, data: [...] }`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Home Feed (legacy full)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"filter\": \"all\",\n  \"country\": [\"IN\"],\n  \"device_id\": \"{{deviceId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/home/feed",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "home",
                "feed"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Legacy full Metflix Home feed (hero + all CTR rows + genres).\nPrefer `/home/bootstrap` + `/home/row` for faster first paint.\n\n**Body**\n- `filter`: all | movies | tv (default all)\n- `country`: \"IN\" or [\"IN\"]\n- `device_id` (optional) -> user flags + my_list row"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
