              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"page\": 1,\n  \"limit\": 20,\n  \"sort\": \"popularity\",\n  \"order\": \"desc\",\n  \"search\": null,\n  \"genre_id\": [28, 35],\n  \"provider_id\": [8],\n  \"country\": [\"IN\", \"US\"],\n  \"spoken_language\": null,\n  \"original_language\": [\"hi\", \"en\"],\n  \"vote_average_gte\": 7,\n  \"vote_count_gte\": 100,\n  \"release_date_gte\": \"2020-01-01\",\n  \"release_date_lte\": null,\n  \"released_only\": true,\n  \"saved_only\": false,\n  \"watched_only\": false,\n  \"include_total\": false,\n  \"device_id\": \"{{deviceId}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/movies",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "movies"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paginated movie list with filters.\n\n**Body params**\n- `page` (int, default 1)\n- `limit` (int, 1-50, default 20)\n- `sort`: popularity | vote_average | release_date | title\n- `order`: asc | desc\n- `search` (string)\n- `genre_id`: int or [int]\n- `provider_id`: int or [int] (TMDB provider ids)\n- `country`: \"IN\" or [\"IN\",\"US\"]\n- `spoken_language` (string)\n- `original_language`: \"hi\" | \"hi|en\" | [\"hi\",\"en\"]\n- `vote_average_gte` (float)\n- `vote_count_gte` (int)\n- `release_date_gte` / `release_date_lte` (YYYY-MM-DD)\n- `released_only` (bool)\n- `saved_only` / `watched_only` (bool) -- requires `device_id`\n- `include_total` (bool, default false) -- skip COUNT(*) when false\n- `device_id` (optional) -> adds `is_watched` / `is_saved_for_later`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
